Bind Npc 26055 Zone 1

On greeting
    If quest 220 is started and player has 910054000
        Say "I am the Patroller, the Guardian of the Fifth Key! You possess the [Fourth Key], so you are qualified to hear the question. Will you accept the challenge?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "Is it Logos who created mankind?"
            Topic "No, that's incorrect" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910054000
                    Give 1 of 910055000
            Topic "Yes, that's correct" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910054000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. As a penalty, the [Fourth Key] you possessed has been destroyed. Now, I will leave to search for the secret of the keys elsewhere."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 220 is started
        Say "I am the Patroller, the Guardian of the Fifth Key! I only pose questions to those who bring the [Fourth Key]."
    Else
        Say ""
